<title>USA: NYSEG says to review CalEnergy bid.</title>
<headline>NYSEG says to review CalEnergy bid.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York State Electric &amp; Gas Corp (NYSEG) said its board of directors will, in due course, review the unsolicited offer made by CalEnergy Corp.</p>
<p>The company urged shareholders to take no action on the offer until its board issues a recommendation.</p>
<p>CalEnergy earlier said it would launch a $159 million, or $24.50 per share, tender offer for 9.9 percent of NYSEG. It also offered to buy the whole company in a friendly transaction for $1.9 billion, or $27.50 per share.</p>
<p>((--Robin Sidel, 212/859-1723))</p>
